Linux source
------------

kernel/ contains an imported upstream Linux source snapshot plus local board,
driver and diagnostic changes. Original source commit and archive digest are
recorded in configs/layout.json. The import tag denotes this repository's
snapshot, rather than the original upstream Git commit object. Original source
copyrights, SPDX identifiers, COPYING, LICENSES and license exceptions are
retained. The source history and technical milestones identify local changes.

The panel-lenovo-j706f driver acknowledges its basis in David Wronek's
panel-raydium-rm69380 driver; its existing copyright and GPL-2.0-only notice
remain in the source. Other per-file upstream attributions remain authoritative.

