Hardware research
-----------------

Board investigation compared device-supplied firmware configuration and related
Lenovo/Qualcomm Android kernel implementation. Related source is evidence of an
implementation, not proof that every deployed proprietary binary is identical.
Technical milestones distinguish hypotheses from validated outcomes.
Stock firmware, calibration and private captures are not bundled or relicensed.

